{"data":{"description":"Rope is a crafting component, used in 18 recipes such as Satchel Charges, Catapults, Compound Bows and Shotgun Traps. You can't craft it, so buy it at [Outpost](/monument/outpost) for 30 cloth each, though the price shifts, or loot it. [Tackleboxes](/world/tacklebox) always drop 1, Underwater Advanced Crates have a 62.81% chance at 1-6 and basic jungle crates 42.13%. In a Green Recycler, a [Wooden Ladder](/items/wooden-ladder) or [Sewing Kit](/items/sewing-kit) gets you 1 back, with a 50% chance at a second.","item":{"id":"rope","name":"Rope","path":"/v1/items/rope.json","slug":"rope"},"name":"Rope","path":"/v1/recycler/rope.json","recyclers":[{"guaranteed":[{"amount":22,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"percentage":[{"amount":50,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-red","name":"Red Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-red.json","slug":"recycler-red"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":18,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-green-powered","name":"Green Recycler (powered)","path":"/v1/world/recycler-green-powered.json","slug":"recycler-green-powered"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":15,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-green","name":"Green Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-green.json","slug":"recycler-green"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":12,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-yellow","name":"Yellow Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-yellow.json","slug":"recycler-yellow"}}],"shortName":"rope"},"meta":{"apiVersion":"v1","dataset":{"createdAt":"2026-11-05T05:52:09+00:00","previousVersion":"2026-10","version":"2026-11"},"schemaVersion":1,"source":{"name":"rusthelp.com","url":"https://rusthelp.com"}}}
